{"id":"713659217","kind":"article","title":"数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-08-09","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":20,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":668,"keywords":["工作记忆","数学探索","认知负荷","数学教学设计","电子游戏"],"summary":"作者指出，数学问题通常先以文字呈现，学习者需把问题情境构建到工作记忆后，才能像玩游戏一样试验对象。书面描述到认知模型的转换需要语言努力；若能用计算机模拟呈现，或可降低探索门槛。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/713659217","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"F74bKTHl\"><b>在数学探索中，我们首先需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆中。</b>这与玩<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Video_game&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏</a>或使用 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duolingo</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> 等应用程序的体验有所不同。在游戏或应用中，所有的操作对象都直观呈现，用户可以立即与之互动。而在数学中，问题往往以文字描述的形式出现在纸上，这种描述并不等同于问题本身。要真正开始探索这些数学对象，我们必须先在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Working_memory&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">工作记忆</a>中构建起它们的模型。</p><p data-pid=\"RkOqSIIf\">一旦你把问题「加载」到工作记忆中，就可以像玩游戏一样进行试验。只是从书面形式转换到认知媒介——即「下载到大脑」的过程——需要一些语言上的努力。我们能否将这种「认知媒介材料」呈现为计算机模拟？</p><p data-pid=\"FdOcDBjS\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学版多邻国</a>的一个问题是，在数学中，如果你想思考一个问题或定理，通常需要把很多东西加载到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Working_memory&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">工作记忆</a>中。所以，即使只是「玩」，也需要这个初始加载过程。然而，一旦你把东西加载到工作记忆中，你往往可以以有趣的方式进行试验，像 Duolingo 那样的小任务也能很好地发挥作用。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"AyJU3W7w\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏允许即时的探索</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"sVjW9DK0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学头脑</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"vT6YUXSJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"jFre6qaG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"vTL596Bi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏 vs 数学</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Z9EWycfd\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"NM_3NgOo\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"h_y9KB99\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏允许即时的探索</a>‎  (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Video+games+allow+immediate+exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"cme4bsBY\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学头脑</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Thinking+Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)<br/> </li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"V9nBBFrA\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 claude-3.5-sonnet、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tinkering in math requires loading the situation into working memory</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> Duolingo 多邻国 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"693330899\" href=\"#/post/693330899\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 电子游戏允许即时的探索 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"710894633\" href=\"#/post/710894633\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 数学头脑 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654018762\" href=\"#/post/654018762\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 面向数学的《时空幻境》 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"715765481\" href=\"#/post/715765481\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"710894633","title":"电子游戏允许即时的探索","author":"Issa Rice","votes":11,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"714263767","title":"比较教学场景","author":"Issa Rice","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"693330899","title":"Duolingo 多邻国","author":"Issa Rice","votes":52,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"716414197","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"654018762","title":"数学头脑","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"},{"id":"1916570545358627430","title":"认知负荷理论","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":51,"minutes":7,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「认知负荷」· Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[]}